{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120508","id":3905580113,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7oymxR","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120508","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120508.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120508.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120508","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120508/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120508/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120508/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/2933c8b379ff5eb84e27a1e0f75343c29d49886f","number":120508,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[DRAFT] Add non-allocating versions of `PhysicsDirectSpaceState[2D|3D]` query methods","user":{"login":"Chestnut45","id":48457382,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NDU3Mzgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48457382?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45","html_url":"https://github.com/Chestnut45","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n*While looking for related PRs I noticed some recent ones that attempted to do something very similar, but they were entirely AI generated, so I feel the need to say that I do not and will never submit AI generated code for review.*\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Slow raycasts due to dictionary creation overhead in all languages\r\n- Related #112433 #113970 \r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThis PR adds a non-allocating version of intersect_ray to `PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D` by registering a new RefCounted type: `PhysicsRayQueryResult3D`, and adding `PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D.intersect_ray_no_alloc(params: PhysicsRayQueryParameters3D, result: PhysicsRayQueryResult3D)`. This gives an alternate raycasting path with very good performance on all supported languages, without requiring waiting for native structs or custom variants to come to GDScript.\r\n\r\nThis PR is very similar in spirit to #113970 (and the same motivation applies) except it adds the non-allocating version alongside the existing implementation to avoid breaking changes. \r\n\r\n~I've run some [preliminary benchmarks](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112433#issuecomment-4759798217)  on the non-allocating version using a raycasting rope simulation in a custom 4.5.1 build with the same changes~ More accurate isolated benchmarks below.\r\n\r\n## TODO:\r\n\r\n- [x] Add `get_result_ptr()` to result type, avoid calling setters manually in `_intersect_ray_no_alloc`\r\n- [x] Add documentation with doctools\r\n- [x] Add tests\r\n- [x] Microbenchmarks\r\n- [ ] Add equivalent API for the rest of PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D/2D (shape casts, get_rest_info, etc.)\r\n- [ ] Refactor once naming is agreed on\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-06-21T02:04:03Z","updated_at":"2026-07-19T16:01:05Z","closed_at":"2026-07-19T15:58:08Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"Chestnut45:intersect-ray-no-alloc","ref":"intersect-ray-no-alloc","repo":null,"sha":"2933c8b379ff5eb84e27a1e0f75343c29d49886f","user":{"login":"Chestnut45","id":48457382,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NDU3Mzgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48457382?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45","html_url":"https://github.com/Chestnut45","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/starred{/o